description: ModueAgent Project Guidelines and Zero-Trust Security Rules
globs: **/*.py, **/*.md, **/*.toml
alwaysApply: true
---

All development within this repository must adhere to the master standards defined in `AGENTS.md`.

- Enforce Zero-Trust capability validation on every tool call.
- Do not add third-party dependencies to `src/modueagent/`.
- Never use `eval()` or `exec()` — use `safe_eval_arithmetic()`.
- Always discard raw tool outputs after extracting whitelisted fields via `extract_safe()`.
